window.products.push({"id":439004,"name":"Ceramic Wax Melt Warmer, Electric Wax Melter and Scent Diffuser with Silicone Tray and Automatic Timer, 100% Safe, No Flame, Wick or Soot, Decorative ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51qQCxtycSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Scented candles come with many benefits. This candle warmer work great at masking unpleasant odors in your home. And the right scents do a world of good for your health and well-being. It’s no wonder you’re so hooked on them. The problem is that candles are a fire hazard. No matter how careful you are, there is no denying the fact that accidents do happen. Plus, drips on your furniture and the candelabra simply do not make for a pleasant sight. The Cocopin Ceramic Candle Warmer offers a safe and mess-free way to enjoy the relaxing warmth and scent of wax. Get the same ambient light you love about candles, but without the worries of keeping a fire hazard in your home. Our wax warmer lets you set the timer to your preferred duration, and leave it to shut off on its own. The automated control provides both convenience and assurance of safety. Our candle warmer lets you enjoy the benefits of aromatherapy to the fullest! Use lavender wax to ease your mind and to feel more relaxed. Count on eucalyptus to keep you energized and help you stay focused. Unwind from a hard day’s work with our ceramic candle melter comforting you with its soft light and soothing scent. We advise users of our candle warmer to use soy wax. Not only do they work better with our silicone dish, but they are also safer for your health. Unlike paraffin, which are made from toxic petroleum, this type of wax is made from natural soybeans. Here are other reasons to love our candle warmer: 🕯️ Melting without smoke. No need to deal with soot! 🕯️ Wax longevity can be adjusted 🕯️ Without a flame masking the scent, the wax comes off more fragrant and pure Bask in your favorite scented wax without worries. Add the Cocopin Ceramic Candle Warmer to your cart TODAY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51qQCxtycSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cocopin","source_asin":"B0972GD49Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-439004","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0972GD49Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0972GD49Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
