window.products.push({"id":439033,"name":"Air Fryer Silicone Liners,Foldable and Easy to Store Air Fryer Silicone Pot for 3 to 5 QT,Food Safe Non Stick Reusable Air Fryer Oven Accessories Repl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ceRujUCaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"👩‍🍳[Cleaning Is A Breeze]—Do you often use the ninja air fryer to cook food,but struggle with the difficulty of cleaning the air fryer? YDYDAFY ninja air fryer liners can help you solve this problem very well, keeps your airfryer liner free from food residue, grease, and grime without compromising the life span of your air fryer.Soft silicone can be folded at will, easy to rinse, so stains have nowhere to hide.Completely dishwasher safe, allowing you to avoid the trouble of hand washing. 🍗[Cost Saving Alternative]—Still using flammable disposable parchment paper? Our ninja air fryer accessories use premium, BPA free, food-grade silicone that can handle up to 450°F/230°C.reusable,avoiding frequent parchment changes and any unnecessary fire hazards!It's a worthy one-time investment will be rewarded by an ecofriendly & safe alternative. 🍖[Practical Design Ideas]—Our silicone air fryer basket have dozens of raised silicone lines to ensure air circulation and distribute heat evenly to cook your foods to the perfection in less time! High in the middle, low around,3D drainage grooves,seperated oil filtering, Helps the oil to the edge of the tray while cooking, preventing the food from being soaked in oil and making your food more crispy! The ninja foodi accessories has handles on both sides for easy removal from the air fryer. 💯[Wide Application]—Multi-purpose in one pot to meet more daily needs,our airfryer liners are not only for use in air fryers, but also safe for use in ovens,microwaves and freezers.Not only can be used as air fryer accessories,but also fruit bowls. 🎁[An Indispensable Ninja Dual Air Fryer Liners] - Rectangle air fryer liners with Heat Proof Gloves perfect for Ninja Foodi Dual DZ201/DZ401.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ceRujUCaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YDYDAFY","source_asin":"B0BF9QWRBQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-439033","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BF9QWRBQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BF9QWRBQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":439034,"name":"Green Culture Expandable Worm Tower - 5 Trays","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31EA2TVG29L._AC_.jpg","description":"Worm composting is an incredibly efficient way to convert kitchen scraps into nutrient-rich compost for your garden. But sorting out the undigested scraps can be messy and inconvenient. The Expandable Worm Tower automatically separates food scraps from finished compost. Simply fill the bottom tray with red wriggler composting worms, bedding and food scraps. As these top feeding worms finish digesting, they will naturally seek more food and migrate upward into the tray above which has newly added goodies, leaving rich castings behind. By continually adding new food trays at the top, and emptying the bottom tray's vermicompost into the garden, you will insure a constant supply of castings. Pictured - 3 Tray System. In full operation, the Worm Tower houses 10,000 to 12,000 worms, consumes 5 to 8 pounds of food a day, allowing you to harvest a full tray of castings per month. Each Worm Tower comes with full instructions and everything you need to get started (except worms and food scraps, of course). The Worm Tower is made in the United States, constructed from high quality recycled plastic, with a limited 5 year warranty on materials and workmanship. It is very simple to assemble","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31EA2TVG29L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Green Culture","source_asin":"B000BWJPZS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-439034","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000BWJPZS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000BWJPZS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
