window.products.push({"id":439124,"name":"Yungala Blue Wine Glasses Set of 6 Blue Goblets - Blue Glassware for Vintage Wine Glasses, Colorful Wine Glasses, Colored Glassware or Glass Goblets","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":54.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/918fGWB3CJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A note on the color ; the blue color we use has changed to a sky blue, we previously had more of a grey/blue however we have removed the smoky element and it is now a true blue. The style of glass is pressed rather than blown so it is a much stronger chunky style of glass so it is really sturdy meaning you will enjoy them for years of stress free entertaining. Worry free and fuss free with dishwasher safe durability. Unlike other BLUE colored glassware the glass is the part of the glass meaning it won’t chip, peel or fade, and is completely Dishwasher Safe so you will enjoy these BLUE Wine glasses for many years to come. Gift and Special occasion party Glassware Set and Blue. Drinking Glasses set boxed ready for Gift giving and celebrating. Don’t be fooled by cheap and inferior products .The Quality of glass is completely Apparent, premium materials create Shine and Brilliance .Enjoy the best of both Worlds with glasses pretty enough for a wedding or the Dining event and Strong enough for everyday use. So versatile , Blue vintage glasses will take you from brunch to dinner , boho cups at Breakfast ,Juice glasses colored for Fun as a Smoke water Goblet for wine , BLUE champagne flutes or BLUE party Glasses. Why serve wine in a glass meant for ice cream? This BLUE goblet is also unique in that it is in true wine glass shape. Suitable for ice cream than Wine! You won’t hesitate to drink your finest wines from these stunning glasses. The style of glass is pressed rather than blown so it is a much stronger chunky style of glass so it is really sturdy meaning you will enjoy them for years of worries free entertaining. Worry free and Fuss free with Dishwasher safe Durability. The embossed BLUE glassware with Sunflower inspired pattern is classic vintage glassware. Pair with our BLUE water tumblers for a glamorous and pretty table scape filled with love and enjoy as you come together with friends and family, who will appreciate these goblet party glasses are as individual as you. Vintage glassware embossed glass drinking goblets are sure to turn heads. Say no to boring and yes to colored wine glasses. They are fancy, classy and super cute and ever so romantic! No risk purchase, 100% satisfaction guarantee. We want you to be thrilled with your new fancy wine glasses. Returns in undamaged original packaging. To reduce the risk of breakages our glasses are packed in polyfoam, but in the unlikely event any are broken we will immediately replace them. If you are using these for an event please note for health reasons they are not returnable after use. All returns must be in undamaged original packaging.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/918fGWB3CJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yungala","source_asin":"B0BD46S11M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-439124","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BD46S11M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BD46S11M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
