window.products.push({"id":439157,"name":"Chelsea Home Imports Magical White Falling Snow Christmas Tree Light Flurries System","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":58.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71M3Zqix-TL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Enjoy the enchantment of a gentle snowfall with Tree Flurries Indoor Light Show. This lighting system creates a realistic snowing effect by reflecting shiny, flurry-like lights onto any wall. The mechanism has variable speed controls to let you adjust how fast the snow falls. Includes an AC power cord and a compatible USB plug for merriment in more places. On/off switch. Power cord, 6.5 feet. Light cord, 3.5 feet. Plastic and glass. For differing effects, the rotation speed of the ball can be adjusted using the speed dial located inside the \"present box.\" For different size snowflakes, move the lamp closer or farther away from the snowball until desired effect is achieved. For a more dense effect, add a 2nd or 3rd Tree Flurries \"present box\" to your display. By adding more Tree Flurries at different rotation speeds or angles, you can create fascinating effects. Tree Flurries will make a nice addition to your holiday decor. It will compliment all of your existing display items. Can be used in college dorms, fraternity houses, your home, office, parties. Perfect addition for a very cool light show. To add excitement to your outdoor decorations, try Light Flurries. Product Features: The patented rotating ball produces a display of falling snow with a random light pattern in vertical motion. Power supply, motor and mirrored \"snowball\" are housed in a decorative green box with red bow. Additional Product Features: Variable speed control, easy set up and storage, portable and discreet. UL listed for indoor or outdoor use. 79\" black USB lead cord with power adapter. Wire gauge: 24 Adjustable LED light source. Dimensions of box: 5.5\"H x 5.25\"W x 5.25\"D Material(s): plastic/glass/metal/wire Note: ambient light may affect the brightness of the falling snow.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71M3Zqix-TL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chelsea Home Imports","source_asin":"B015NN4FAE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-439157","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B015NN4FAE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B015NN4FAE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
