window.products.push({"id":439165,"name":"Fivent 24-Piece Black Butterfly Silverware Set, Service for 4, Stainless Steel Flatware Set with Steak Knives, Mirror Polished Cutlery Set, Hand Wash ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BQeCeCcpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌷BLACK BUTTERFLY AND FLOWER PATTERNED CUTLERY SET - With a beautiful Damask Rose pattern, this chic black colored cutlery set is the perfect way to spruce up your dining table for a chic and stylish new look that you can enjoy at every meal. Impress your friends and family when they come round for dinner, when you set the table with our unique cutlery, designed for everyone to enjoy! 🌷STAINLESS STEEL TABLEWARE - This 24 piece cutlery set really was built to last - created to be durable and long-lasting, we've made this set from durable stainless steel. It feels great to hold each eating utensil and with correct and proper care, stainless steel cutlery ensures no loss of shine over time and no rusting or corrosion, keeping your family safe and healthy. 🌷DISHWASHER SAFE - Cleaning up after breakfast, lunch and dinner has never been easier! Designed to save you and your family time, all of the cutlery in this set of forks, spoons and knives and dishwasher safe. So you can spend less time in the kitchen, and more quality time with the family! Included in this set are: 4 x dinner knives, 4 x dinner spoons, 4 x dinner forks, 4 x teaspoons and 4 x salad forks. 🌷MIRROR POLISH FLATWARE - Enhance your dining room table decor and turn every meal into a fine dining experience - these modern knives, forks and spoons are all mirror polished to give you a premium dining experience every time. Enjoy high-shine, perfect flatware at every meal, with this premium set of flatware. 🌷IDEAL FOR ANY HOME KITCHEN - Enjoy eating meals with the whole family every day! This a 20-piece service for 4 - making our cutlery sets ideal for any home kitchen to bring a chic and stylish feel to your kitchen and dining room. With their premium look and sleek design, it's an easy way to add unique pieces to your kitchen accessories and perfect for everyday use for any table setting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BQeCeCcpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fivent","source_asin":"B09PBXCF9G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-439165","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PBXCF9G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PBXCF9G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
