window.products.push({"id":439335,"name":"Emousport 6 Cavity Stone Shape Silicone Cake Mold Baking Moulds Pastry Decorating Molds Tools for Soap, Muffin, Brownie, Mousse","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.26,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51D92NiJcYL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"【High Quality】The cake mold is made of food grade silicone, which is flexible and non-stick, easy to demould, safe and reliable, it is more convenient to use than hard plastic molds, can be reused many times, and these molds will not break easily. 【Easy to use】The cake mold is easy to use, prepare the mixed materials in advance and pour it into the cake mold. After waiting for a while until they are dry, turn the mold upside down and gently lift the material out and unmold. 【Non-Stick Design】Easy to release, taking food out of cake mold is no longer a tough job. Unlike traditional hard plastic trays, these molds are easily disassembled and anyone can easily remove or release food from the molds. Because of its silicone material, the cake molds are non-stick, the food pops out easily, and there is no residue. It can withstand repeated use day after day without deformation or fading. 【Easy to Clean】These cake molds are non-stick silicone material construction, easy to clean and won't crack or break like hard plastic molds. Dishwasher or soap and sponge for easy cleaning. 【Multifunctional】These cake molds can not only be used to make cakes, chocolates, candies, cakes, jellies, puddings and other foods, but also can be used to make exquisite waxes, candles, soaps, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51D92NiJcYL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Emousport","source_asin":"B07D98QH47","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-439335","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07D98QH47","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07D98QH47","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":439336,"name":"100% Beeswax Candles Set of 3 Candles Sizes: W6 x H13 cm, W6 x H8.5 cm, W6 x H 6.5cm Rolled Unscented Natural Beeswax Scent 100% Handmade Eco Candle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81TtADo10LL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% Beeswax Candles Set of 3 Candles Sizes: W6 x H13 cm, W6 x H8.5 cm, W6 x H 6.5cm, hand rolled, natural beeswax/honey scent, 100% handmade eco-candle *** Unique and natural beeswax candles are unlike other candles, have soft honey scent and purifying effects that don’t release toxins. They create beautiful ambiance with their warm glow. *** Benefits of beeswax candles: * Honey candles is eco-friendly and good for your health, with absolutely no carcinogens or hazardous ingredients.. * Burning 100% pure beeswax create negative ions when burning. * Negative ions neutralize bad positive ions such as allergens, dust and air borne toxins. * Beeswax candles are thought to be healthier than most others. * Created by the bees, 100% natural, all chemical-free. * Smell great as they are naturally scented by the honey and floral nectar in the honeycomb; carbon-neutral. * Have a high melting point (in fact the highest among all known waxes) which results in a significantly longer (2-5 times) burn time and drip very little, if any at all. This offsets their higher cost. * Hypo-allergenic, benefit those with environmental allergies, sensitivities and asthma. * Burn stronger and brighter. Emit naturally bright light of the same light spectrum as the sun. As a beeswax is natural product yellow color many little vary - be brighter or darker. Smell is unique, natural beeswax, no additional scents.They are a gift from nature!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81TtADo10LL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Honey Candle I 100% Beeswax candles I Handmade","source_asin":"B072BNNH9Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-439336","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B072BNNH9Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B072BNNH9Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":439337,"name":"mDesign Metal Hanging Bath and Shower Caddy Organizer for Hand Held Shower Head and Hose - Storage for Shampoo, Conditioner, Hand Soap - 4 Shelf Forma","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61XsPf9ApAL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"STORAGE MADE SIMPLE: Keep shower essentials close at hand with this convenient shower caddy; This caddy features 4 baskets; 1 wide towel bar, 2 suction cups to grip the wall and keep the caddy secure in wet environments, and a non-slip grip at the top; The center section is open to accommodate hand-held shower nozzles - there is space for the hose to hang down the center; Open grid design allows for maximum drainage and air circulation, items dry quickly, reducing the risk of mold and mildew SMART DESIGN: This 2-tier shelf caddy organizer has space to store a wide variety of products in multiple shapes and sizes; The top baskets are great for storing shampoo, conditioner, bath salts, sugar scrubs and body wash; The lower shelf trays are great for hand soap, shaving cream, oils, facial cleansers, and salt scrubs; Circular holes in the bottom of each basket let you store shampoo bottles upside down keeping the contents ready to pour and allowing you to get the most out of your soap EASY INSTALLATION: Simply hang over the shower head, and it is ready to use; The organizing caddy should slide down into place;Designed to work with extra large, rain-style shower heads, just hang over the neck of your shower head and use the suction cups to secure it to the wall; Clean and dry the surface area before pressing the suction cups firmly to the surface; Perfect for home, apartments, condos, dorm rooms, RVs and campers QUALITY CONSTRUCTION: Made of strong steel wire with a durable rust-resistant finish; Plastic suction cups and hook grip; Suction cups adhere best to clean smooth, non-porous surfaces; Made for use in moisture-rich bathroom environments; Easy Care - clean with mild soap and water THOUGHTFULLY SIZED: Measures 6.5\" x 13\" x 16\" high","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61XsPf9ApAL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"mDesign","source_asin":"B071VP7V5T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-439337","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071VP7V5T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B071VP7V5T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
