window.products.push({"id":439354,"name":"Vodche Heat Powered Wood Stove Fan, 4 Blades Fireplace Stove Fan, Large Airflow 50% Fuel Cost Saving, Eco Stove Fan for Gas/Pellet/Wood/Log Burner/Fir","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61G3qGIJy4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"👍【Premium Material】Vodche fireplace stove fan base and blades are made from anodized aluminum which is rust-proof, wear-resisting, with good thermal conductivity. Overheating protection, the in-built bi-metallic strip at the base of the stove fan is designed to raise the edge of the fan slightly as the maximum operating temperature is approached to protect the motor and the myoelectric module. 👍【Large Air Flow】Our heat-powered wood stove fan circulates heat up to 300 cubic feet/minute, is faster to warm, circulates air throughout the room, maximizes the efficiency of your stoves by 50% Fuel Cost Saving. 👍【Quiet & No Noise】The only moving part is the blade assembly, quiet and no noise generate. You will not even know this wood stove fan is there, but you will feel the warmth. 👍【No Running Cost】No batteries or electricity required. The eco stove fan is driven by the heat generated by the fireplace or wood-burning stove and conducts to the fan base to drive the blades. The temperature of the fireplace affects the speed of the fan. 🙏🙏🙏Warm tips: the wood stove fan works when the temperature is between 176℉-482℉ !!! 👍【Lifetime Technical Support】If there is any problem, just contact us directly for solutions. We would help you solve your problems as soon as possible.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61G3qGIJy4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vodche","source_asin":"B0978R19YZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-439354","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0978R19YZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0978R19YZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
