window.products.push({"id":439386,"name":"Hand Painted Shell Dish - Spoon Rest, Ring Holder, Jewelry Holders, Trinket Dishes, Catchall Bowl - Cape Cod Clam Shell With Resin Finish (Starfish)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-rYBTrUsL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"This decorative clam shell dish from Cape Cod is a unique and functional piece of nautical home decor. Each shell dish features a hand painted graphic over a hand painted pearlized base layer and can be used in a variety of ways.  ► SPOON REST: This clam dish bowl is a great spoon holder that gives any kitchen an ocean theme. Keep it next to the stove when cooking – the shell bowl's resin finish ensures that excess food or liquid can be easily wiped away with a damp paper towel.  ► JEWELRY DISH: Place this shell dish on your bedroom bedside table and it becomes a nautical themed rings and things dish.  ► TRINKET DISH: Each clam shell bowl can be used as a beach house themed catchall dish. Use it as a car keys tray, kitchen sink sponge holder, tea bag rest, spare change dish…the possibilities are almost endless!  So how do we make these coastal decor treasures? We start by collecting sea clam shells from our favorite Cape Cod beach at dead low tide. Each shell is then cleaned, painted, and finished off with a layer of epoxy resin.  While each clam shell dish is approximately 6\" by 4.25\", please keep in mind that the dimensions of these natural wonders are subject to slight variations.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-rYBTrUsL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cranberry Collective","source_asin":"B0C5GKMJGL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-439386","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C5GKMJGL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C5GKMJGL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
