window.products.push({"id":439390,"name":"Double Layers Sieve Stainless Steel Hand-held Flour Sifter for Baking Strainer sifters for cooking with Handle flour sifter hand held (Large(5 Cup))","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FxcoCnZvS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Flour sieve is an important step in baking in the process of making cakes. Therefore, a good flour sieve can increase the deliciousness of baking  From baking to adding spices and even shortcrust pastries, this multifunctional sieve is ideal for aerating flour, making the batter fluffy and evenly mixing high-quality ingredients.   Name: Stainless steel large flour sieve Material: 410 stainless steel +201 stainless steel Net weight: 215g Size: 12cm in diameter, 13cm in height Filter: Double-layer fine mesh Usage: Sifting flour/sifting millet, etc. Packing list: 1×flour sieve  How to use: Pour the flour and keep the handle pressed. It only takes 1.5 minutes to sift out the whole cup of flour  Note: Before using the flour sieve, please wipe with a cotton cloth, and then use the flour sieve.. After use, do not rinse with water, as this will easily cause the flour and water droplets to agglomerate and increase the difficulty of cleaning. For the remaining flour, just tap the main body of the sieve lightly! If you must rinse with water, rinse carefully, and then use a hair dryer to dry or wipe dry!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FxcoCnZvS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GDOGDO","source_asin":"B08R3VMKDH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-439390","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08R3VMKDH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08R3VMKDH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
