window.products.push({"id":439453,"name":"Niche Mod 30\" Round Table- Truffle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51QhNvR9qPS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Find your Niche with the versatile and modern Niche collection. Simple, clean and compact, the Niche line is sure to please. This Niche round table is a great choice for breakfast nooks, home offices, dining rooms, cafes and more. A sturdy X-Base ensures stability. Its 30-inch round top is lightweight, making the table easy to move around, even for one person. Its rich dark Truffle finish shows subtle wood grain and is sure to please and coordinates with the rest of the Niche line. No tools LockDowel assembly allows pieces to simply snap together and lock into place for a sturdy, hassle-free build in less than 5 minutes. No more searching for the right size screwdriver or dropping tiny screws. Just snap into place and go. Less hardware and fewer small parts means less plastic packaging and less waste.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51QhNvR9qPS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Niche","source_asin":"B07289HJ2W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-439453","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07289HJ2W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07289HJ2W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":439454,"name":"Home Traditions Single Wick Evenly Burning Highly Scented Votive Candle, Set of 8 (1.8 Oz Each) for Wedding, Birthday, Holiday, & Home Décor - Aloha P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.7,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GJrZ9kHTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Home traditions single wick votive candles are mostly used for décor while giving off a pleasing scent. We suggest that each candle is used with a votive candle holder to prevent accidents. Choose your favorite scent and light it to add ambiance in your home, create a romantic mood, or for aromatherapy. Votive candles make great additions to gift baskets, party favors, or stocking stuffers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GJrZ9kHTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DII","source_asin":"B07RCHBHVF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-439454","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RCHBHVF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RCHBHVF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":439455,"name":"Jamie Oliver's Professional Series by T-fal 8-1/2-Inch Nonstick Saute Pan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31CVR3W1DGL._AC_.jpg","description":"From the Manufacturer 8.5\" stainless-steel sauté pan with Metal Safe nonstick interior plus Thermospot heat indicator Together, Jamie Oliver and T-Fal have designed this handy 8.5\" stainless-steel sauté pan with a high-tech stay-cool ovenproof handle. This pan is construction of heavy-gauge aluminum core base encapsulated in 18/10 polished stainless steel and finished inside with Prometal Nonstick. This professional nonstick coating is safe to use with metal utensils, and extremely easy to clean. The Prometal nonstick sauté pans also feature ThermoSpot--T-Fals unique heat indicator that lets you know when the pan is preheated to the optimum moment to seal in the flavor of your food. This sauté pan gives you the flexibility and control that a real chef would have in a professional kitchen but in your own home. Jamie says, \"Not only do they look really cool but will give you years of great service.\" Dishwasher safe and oven safe to 500 degrees F.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31CVR3W1DGL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"T-fal","source_asin":"B00009XQY7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-439455","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00009XQY7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00009XQY7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":439456,"name":"Bambaw Metal Lunch Box 1200 ML | Adjustable Compartment Lunch Box | Leak Proof Metal Lunch Containers | Eco Stainless Steel Food Containers | Metal Be","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71O2SCorg0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The food you love, in and outdoors Batch-cooking is an invitation to share a moment around food, yes, but also to try out new recipes, cook healthy preparations and improve your wellbeing. Add a lunch metal box to this equation and you got yourself the perfect takeaway meal at school, your office, for your outdoor activities or trips. A strong and lasting lunch box This metal lunch containers leakproof is non-toxic, BPA-free, and lasts longer than single-use plastic containers. This bento box for adults is solid and will, without its lid, resist campfire or can be placed into the oven. Since it is made of metal it cannot be placed in the microwave. Since stainless steel is inert, meaning it is unlikely to alter other things it comes in contact with, it makes Bambaw’s hard lunch box for men is the safest for your health. It also guarantees that the camping snack container is 100% neutral in taste and odour. Reducing (food) waste Together with reducing your consumption of single-use plastic containers, and therefore the amount of trash you generate each day, a stainless steel leakproof bento box will help you fight food waste. Thanks to its removable and BPA-free silicone ring, allowing the stainless steel tiffin to be completely hermetic, your food will stay fresher, considerably slowing down its decomposition rate resulting in less food being thrown away. Bambaw’s On The Go collection Get the full package for zero-waste outdoors meals by completing your purchase with the insulated stainless-steel or regular water bottle and the reusable bamboo cutlery set. Master the Bring Your Own mantra, leaving you to peaceful digestion and nature free of plastic waste.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71O2SCorg0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bambaw","source_asin":"B09X8LRTF4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-439456","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09X8LRTF4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09X8LRTF4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
