window.products.push({"id":439545,"name":"Aitliving Soft Cotton Velvet Aquatic Blue Pillow Case Porcelain Light Blue Lumbar Pillow Cover with Cotton Linen Reverse, Sky Blue Solid Colour Handma","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.09,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51wyMg5sk4L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Aitliving Brand New Designed Solid Soft Vintage 100% Cotton Velvet Lumbar Couch Front Throw Pillow Covers/Euro Pillowcases (Pls be understanding and allow about 1 cm difference for sewing size) Several Sizes Products For Your Review & Selection:  30cmX50cm (12X20 inch pillow cushion cover); 46cmX46cm (18X18 inch pillow cover); 43cmX43cm (17X17 inch); 50cmX50cm (20x20 inch); 65cmX65cm (26x26 inch euro pillowcase cushion cover); New Seasons' Colors: Slate Blue, Pale Blush, Navy Blue, Gold, Charcoal Grey, Indigo Blue, Ocean Atlantis Blue, Sienna Yellow, Rosewater Peach Blush, Dusk lilac, Sky light blue, Yellow ochre sauterne gold, Silver gray, Slate navy blue cushion pillow covers.  NOTE: The photos are taken by real items in natural or photography lights indoor, and the pillow cushion covers' colors may differ due to different smart phones /tablets /computers monitor screens..Why Option for 100% Cotton Fabric Cover?  >1> Trees grow after years of planting. Petroleum used to produce man-made fibers is non-renewable resource and difficult to decompose and degrade after use.  >2> For cotton fabrics and products, the raw material of cotton yarn before production is cotton, that is annual plant and belongs to pure natural plant cellulose and natural fiber material. Cotton products, when not in use, can be completely decomposed by microorganisms etc. under natural environmental conditions, so they are very environmentally friendly products that can be degraded after use.  >3> We always pay great attention to environmental protection issues in production, life, and daily life. Also hope to do the best for environmental protection, using natural materials and cotton velvet fabrics, and using environmentally friendly reactive dyeing.  >4> The cotton material fabric is relatively more soft comfortable, moisture-absorbing and breathable, less static, cozy relax and washable, less allergenic.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51wyMg5sk4L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aitliving","source_asin":"B09Y4C8BRB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-439545","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Y4C8BRB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Y4C8BRB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":439546,"name":"Beechwood Mountain BSD-28S-C Solid Beech Wood Side Chairs in Cherry for Kitchen & Dining, Set of 2, NA","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zVVIU4akL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our chairs and barstools are made from the finest solid European “beech” wood, also known as the “hard wearing” wood. The hard surfaces of “beech” wood products will resist gouging and chipping better than some other woods. These chairs and/or barstools can fit just about in any room in your home or office and will surely look great with any decor. Whether you go for the modern look or traditional seating you're sure to find it in our collection.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zVVIU4akL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beechwood Mountain","source_asin":"B01MXCWUOX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-439546","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MXCWUOX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MXCWUOX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
