window.products.push({"id":439563,"name":"Bag Sealer, Mini Portable Handheld Heat Sealer, Reseal Kitchen Sealing Machine for Chip Bags, Plastic Food Bags, Snack & Cereal Bags, White (Battery I","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611qgo4ryXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":">>2 in 1 Heat sealer & cutter: This mini bag sealer is very suitable for packaging and preventing food and snacks from getting wet and spoiled. It can perfectly replace clips and rubber bands without worrying about the waste caused by incomplete snacks. The heat sealer has two functions, one side is a sealer and the other is a cutter. You can quickly seal and cut at any time. This is a great choice for people who love snacks. >>Easy to use: Install the 2AA batteries (package included), slide the cover to expose the heater. Press the mini sealing machine and slide the sealer slowly along the bag edge at a constant speed. For better results, the sealer can be repeated multiple times. >>Tiny and convenient mini sealer: This mini portable sealer is more compact and easy to carry, and can be easily put into your bag or pocket. Whether you go camping, or the kitchen and living room at home, you can use it to cut and seal easily and conveniently. The back is magnet, you can easily attach it on your refrigerator. It has lanyard on top for hung on a hook. >>Better food storage: Don't worry about food being leaked or opened causing confusion or food deterioration. Now you can safely keep all your food or snacks dry and fresh for a few days without causing waste. The mini portable sealer is suitable for food storage bags, snack bags, candy bags, potato chip bags, and packaging bags. The small sealer is a good food saver. >>Noted: When the battery power is insufficient, the sealing effect will be affected. Please replace the battery in time. If you will not use it for a long time, please remove the battery. It fits to coated aluminum foil bags are recommended PP,PE,PVC bags with thickness no more than 0.3mm. Not suitable for pure paper packaging, pure aluminium bags.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611qgo4ryXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JJLVTEK","source_asin":"B096MHJQ37","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-439563","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096MHJQ37","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B096MHJQ37","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
