window.products.push({"id":439881,"name":"Sweese 520.204 Porcelain Baking Dishes, Non-stick Lasagna Pans, Large Rectangular Baking Pan set, Casserole Dishes, Set of 2, Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+cyFhvrxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you looking for the perfect baking dish? — If you love making and serving delicious foods and want to take it to the next level, the Sweese Baking Dish will be the right choice for your cooking, baking and serving need. WHY CHOOSE US? ✔ Commercial Grade Material - Lead and cadmium free healthy porcelain. ✔ Pretty And Useful - They are ideal bakeware for baking, casserole, lasagna etc. ✔ Perfect Size - Large Rectangular 13x9 Baking Pan enough for you and your family and friends to enjoy together. Get ready to show off your cooking skills at the party for the upcoming holidays! ✔ Easy To Clean - These porcelain cups can be cleaned up safely in the dishwasher. Also can be washed with soap and hot water by hand if needed. No need to worry about stains. ✔ Excellent Quality - Microwave safe, dishwasher safe, oven safe, freezer safe, broiler safe. ✔ Attentive Service - Carefully packaged to avoid breakage during delivery. ✔ Best Blessing - Best gift choice for housewarmings, weddings, Mother's Day, Father's Day or even Christmas! CAUTION Ceramics will become hot when placed in either an oven or microwave - best to handle with care YOUR CONFIDENCE ASSURED ✔ 30 Day No-Chip Warranty ✔ 100% Satisfaction Guarantee ABOUT SWEESE ✔ In 2014, a kitchen lover is devoted to making designs different from others that will become the essentials of your kitchen and tabletop. ✔ Sweese means that we sweeten up your home. ✔ We specializes in the building of daily life scenes in kitchen, including dinnerware, drinkware, teawear and serveware. ✔ Sweese focuses on three aspects of the product: natural environment, durability, and easy to clean.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+cyFhvrxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sweese","source_asin":"B0BB2F16LZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-439881","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BB2F16LZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BB2F16LZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":439882,"name":"Moonrise Black Dog Labrador Lake by Ryan Fowler Wall Decor, 35 by 35-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":73.48,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91JD6BBhE7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features a black lab on a dock by moonlight. Ryan Fowler is an illustrator and graphic artist based in Chicago and Middlebury, Vermont. Ryan received his MFA from Rhode Island School of Design where he studied photography. His artistic process was informed by his study of photography and photographic printing methods, both in the darkroom and on the computer. Ryan uses a hybrid of traditional and modern techniques utilizing drawings, paintings and computer-based illustration tools. Ryan covers a variety of subject matter with his work including animals, landscapes, children's art, typography and graphic design. His work is inspired by nature, advertising design and New England and Pacific Northwest iconography. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91JD6BBhE7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00OA9013I","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-439882","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00OA9013I","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00OA9013I","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
