window.products.push({"id":439924,"name":"Oyizer Gold Flatware, 5 Piece 18/10 Stainless Steel Cutlery Silverware Matte Black Handle Including Dinner Spoon Teaspoon Fork Knife Chopsticks & Trav","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gbrG1r7OL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Oyizer 5 Piece 18/10 Stainless Steel Cutlery Set with Mette Handle. Each set has Dinner Spoon, Teaspoon, Fork, Knife, Chopsticks, a waterproof travel box and a bag that makes it portable and easily movable. . .  The product is made of 18/10 (304) Stainless Steel: 18/10 Stainless Steel is the highest quality. The number signifies that the alloy contains 18 percent chromium and 10 percent nickel. While the 18 percent chromium makes the metal rust- and stain-resistant, the nickel gives it shine and luster. The remainder of the metal is composite steel, which makes the flatware durable and strong. . .  The dimensions and weight of each item are as follows: -dinner knife: 22*1.5cm | 60g ss420 -dinner spoon: 21*5cm | 78g ss304 -dinner fork: 21.8*2.7cm | 65g ss304 -teaspoon: 12*2.9cm | 21g ss304 -chopsticks: 23cm | 35g -case: 25*6*3cm 65g . . .  Some of the Peculiar Features Include: . 1.The organizer case makes it easy to carry and portable. Also, it is a perfect choice for a gift for a wedding, birthday, anniversary, Christmas or Thanksgiving. . . 2.The set is well suited for everyday use. . .  Instructions for Use and Care: . 1.Kindly rinse properly with hand before the first use. .  2.For subsequent use, rinse off remains of food on the utensil as soon as possible after meals. . 3. Kindly wash by hand for the first few days (if use is daily) or the first few times of use (if used occasionally). This will condition the flatware. Afterwards, user could use a dishwasher. . 4.It is recommended that the user does not apply too much detergent as it might form rust on stainless steel. . 5.In the unlikely chance that rust appears on the utensils, the best thing to do is to clean with an all-purpose metal cleaner. . We are glad to answer any further questions with regard to the use and care of the utensil set. Thank you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gbrG1r7OL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Unknown","source_asin":"B0BLYM1CBK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-439924","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLYM1CBK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLYM1CBK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
