window.products.push({"id":439939,"name":"PANDICORN Set of 2 Summer Lemon Pillow Covers 18x18 with Quotes for Home Décor, Modern Farmhouse Blue and Yellow Throw Pillows Cases for Outdoor Porch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UDnA4VnGL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"● BRIGHTEN UP YOUR LIFE WITH THIS BLUE AND YELLOW LEMON PILLOW COVERS SET OF 2. THEY WILL LOOK GREAT ON SUMMER, AND THE PERFECT ADDITION TO YOUR PORCH, DOORWAY, PATIO GARDEN BENCH OR CHAIR.  ● The farmhouse throw pillows covers add a rustic, warm appeal for your living room couch, sofa or bed, entryway bench, front porch chair.  ● Our set of two faux burlap pillow cover with saying easily complement any décor, from modern to country, vintage.  ● The perfect housewarming/ birthday/friends’ gifts that’s sure to leave everyone smile.   Product details: ● Material: 100% Linen-Polyester Blends.  ● Size: 18x18 inches/45x45 cm  ● Closure: Smoothly concealed zipper for an easy removal ● Package included: 1Pc Faux Linen Throw Pillow Cover with Blue Words “When Life Gives You Lemon, Make Something Sweet” + 1Pc Faux Linen Throw Pillow Cover with BLUE AND YELLOW LEMON DESIGN , WITHOUT Pillow Insert.  Care Instructions: ● Wash in cold water at gentle cycle.  ● Iron at medium temperature.  ● Do not bleach.  ● Dry flat or hang to dry.  Please Note: ● Pillow insert is NOT INCLUDED. PILLOW COVER ONLY.  ● The colors may vary slightly depending on computer screen settings.  ● The printed pattern of faux linen throw pillow cover is available on FRONT side ONLY, back is solid light linen color WITHOUT printing.  ● To ensure a snug fit and plumper looking pillow, all covers are sewn approx. 1/2 inch (1.3cm) smaller than actual size of pillow, which is the industrial standard.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UDnA4VnGL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PANDICORN","source_asin":"B0879BVCBM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-439939","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0879BVCBM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0879BVCBM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":439940,"name":"Mars Forest Car Air Purifiers, 12V Plug in Car Ionizer HEPA with USB C And USB Charger | Remove PM 2.5 Smoke, Pollutants, Pet and Food Odor, Ionic Ozo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615pmPf5ccL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Welcome to the Mars Forest store, we wish you a good day. You can choose the items you are satisfied with and have a good shopping experience in our store~ Why Choose Car Air Purifier Plug In? Provide safety for your driving, built-in intelligent voltage monitoring chip, real-time monitoring of the car's power frequency voltage, LED smart display real-time monitoring of the car's power frequency voltage to ensure your safe driving. Equipped with 2.1 amp dual USB charging equipment, and the negative ion purifier can release 5.6 million negative ions, which can eliminate second-hand smoke, pets, food and other odors in a small range within a certain period of time. You should know that this car purifier needs to be used for a period of time before you can feel the effect it brings, and it provides you with a dual USB fast charging device. How Does It Work? Low voltage through the booster circuit to dc negative high voltage by negative-Ionizer , using the DC high voltage discharge probe tip , high-speed release a large number of electrons (-e) , Will be the oxygen in air to capture immediately , formation of negative ions . Because the negative ion of oxygen ions and hydration hydroxyl ions, etc,the small negative oxygen ions in the air,or call it a small negative oxygen ion,has the good activity,So called it oxvgen bar . Package Contents 1 X Car Air Purifier Plug In 1 X Color box 1 X Manual Tips Customer self-test results method: Test-1: Use two transparent glass water cups, use cigarettes commonly used in the market, and spit a thick bite into the two cups For second-hand smoke, put one of the cups full of smoke on the working product for about 10 seconds to see the contrast effect directly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615pmPf5ccL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mars Forest","source_asin":"B099ZBPZXM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-439940","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B099ZBPZXM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B099ZBPZXM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
