window.products.push({"id":439983,"name":"Household Essentials Open Tapered Bin with Wood Handles, Medium, Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91+TLNwYqzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This medium open tapered bin offers storage options that reduce clutter and add style and organization. The fabric of the bin is made of a textured PET and cotton blend with wire metal frame for extra stability. Stained wood handles add an attractive touch. PET is the result of a polyester fiber produced from recycled plastic bottles and is used in a variety of household fabrics due to its lightweight durability. What makes PET intriguing is how much energy is saved in production and of course, it consumes what would otherwise go to a landfill, the bottle. So when you see something labeled as PET, rest assured that it is a recycled material and you are doing your part to help the environment. Item #609.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91+TLNwYqzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Household Essentials","source_asin":"B019GKO0F0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-439983","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B019GKO0F0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B019GKO0F0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
