window.products.push({"id":439997,"name":"Liquid Solution Turkey Baster 5 Piece Set, Includes Baster for Cooking, Barbecue Basting Brush, Flavor Injector with Cleaning Brush - Perfect for Than","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615M+7JS8HL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"THE PERFECT MEAL: A perfect Thanksgiving turkey has tender, juicy meat and crisp, golden skin. Having a baster for cooking helps keep meat more moist by cooling the surface and thus slowing down the rate at which the meat cooks. And the more gently the meat cooks, the juicier it will remain. THE RIGHT TOOLS!: With the Liquid Solution turkey baster set you have everything you need. A baster to bring flavor and moisture to the meat, two stainless steel injectors screw onto the baster to send flavor and juices deep into the meat, a basting brush for more precise flavor application, and a cleaning brush to keep everything working perfectly. EASY CLEANING: Basters are easy to wash. The bulb and the tip are removable. The turkey baster cleaning brush is designed to fit perfectly inside the baster shaft, ensuring it can always remain clog-free. The silicone brush is detachable for a thorough cleaning and our food flavor injector screws are also easy to clean. All parts are dishwasher safe. HIGH-QUALITY MATERIALS: Made with heat-resistant silicone and stainless steel materials that won’t crack, melt nor bend, having the advantage of durability. LIQUID SOLUTION GUARANTEE: Liquid Solution has been a trusted kitchen companion for years - from turkey basting to baking, we ensure that each meal is delicious. If for any reason you’re not 100% satisfied with our turkey baster set, we guarantee a full and prompt refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615M+7JS8HL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Liquid Solution","source_asin":"B0925R65JJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-439997","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0925R65JJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0925R65JJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
